{"5076500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "happy goose friends", "steam_appid": 5076500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The geese are out to get you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anywhere, any way—they just want you dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't ask why; they are simply full of *goose-tility*!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a parody game brimming with malice. The map is riddled with traps that are hard to dodge; whether they look dangerous or harmless, one wrong move and you're done for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to evade the geese's attacks and make it to the very end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you there... I wonder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is packed with all sorts of traps, offering you nearly a hundred different ways to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter all kinds of bizarre geese—some are aggressive, and others... well, they're aggressive too. Unfortunately, a goose has stolen your shoes, so you can't run or jump—you can only plod along slowly. Still, the place is huge; who knows? You might just stumble upon a weapon somewhere.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The geese are out to get you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anywhere, any way—they just want you dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't ask why; they are simply full of *goose-tility*!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a parody game brimming with malice. The map is riddled with traps that are hard to dodge; whether they look dangerous or harmless, one wrong move and you're done for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to evade the geese's attacks and make it to the very end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you there... I wonder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is packed with all sorts of traps, offering you nearly a hundred different ways to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter all kinds of bizarre geese—some are aggressive, and others... well, they're aggressive too. Unfortunately, a goose has stolen your shoes, so you can't run or jump—you can only plod along slowly. Still, the place is huge; who knows? You might just stumble upon a weapon somewhere.</p>", "short_description": "The geese are attacking you! Anywhere, any way—the geese just want to kill you! Don’t ask why—they’re just being geese!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5076500/45b313e59a7d3268e9a1eb6ae4d50e6740dfbee3/header.jpg?t=1787757368", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5076500/2fb1f9f5753346e2d0546003a9894e8a30091a94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787757368", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5076500/2fb1f9f5753346e2d0546003a9894e8a30091a94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787757368", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["not goose"], "publishers": ["not goose"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://sh